  "visual_differences": {
    "all": "Live HUD uses current weekday and different type, box widths, alignment and trust bar styling.",
    "q01_q02_q05_q06": "The live map uses different marker rims, an active Quay ring, gate styling, outlines, grid and lantern shading. Toolbar sizing and canal-label coverage differ. The inherited Make up Dhuhr button appears. The transient Isha call is excluded per spec.",
    "q03_q04": "Existing plain block geometry, sky and warm lights provide the quay/canal and lane backgrounds. The master pictures include more detailed buildings, ground and a moonlit sky. Panel border, opacity, font metrics, letter spacing, padding and button widths differ slightly.",
    "q07_q08_q09": "The existing daylight lane and player capsule replace the master's storefront. The live clock shows 10:00 the next day and a Dhuhr countdown. The earned wallets are 238, 278 and 398 rather than the masters' fixed 198. Reputation panel opacity, rule and type spacing, and button widths differ. Trust 45, 40 and 30 and the locked text, source and tone match."
  },
  "pre_release_scholar_review": "Pending under OA-AIOS-432. LOCK 12 §1 cites Jami at-Tirmidhi 1295 on carrying wine and Quran 5:90 on intoxicants. Review the portrayal of the prohibition and carrying wine for payment before public release. DOC-TFG-0320 has no dedicated LOCK 12 row at handover."
